tions Menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right Trigger:</strong> Interact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>L3:</strong> Camera Reset</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R3:</strong> First Person Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start Button:</strong> Options Menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>L3:</strong> Re-center camera</p>",
